41	
42	Under Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code
43	▶ Do not enter social security numbers on this form as it may be made public.
44	▶ Go to www.irs.gov/Form1023 for instructions and the latest information.
45	
46	Use the instructions to complete this application and for a definition of all bold items. For additional help, call IRS Exempt
47	Organizations Customer Account Services toll-free at 1-877-829-5500. Visit our website at www.irs.gov for forms and publications. If
48	the required information and documents are not submitted with payment of the appropriate user fee, the application may be returned
49	to you.
50	Attach additional sheets to this application if you need more space to answer fully. Put your name and EIN on each sheet and
51	identify each answer by Part and line number. Complete Parts I – XI of Form 1023 and submit only those Schedules (A through H) that
52	apply to you.
