2032	
2033	Relationship with Supported Organization(s)—Three Tests
2034	
2035	To be classified as a supporting organization, an organization must meet one of three relationship tests.
2036	Test 1: “Operated, supervised, or controlled by” one or more publicly supported organizations, or
2037	Test 2: “Supervised or controlled in connection with” one or more publicly supported organizations, or
2038	Test 3: “Operated in connection with” one or more publicly supported organizations.
